    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opponent's Movement phase as soon as an enemy unit that is not a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** is chosen to Fall Back. Pick 1 **HERETIC ASTARTES DAEMON VEHICLE** or **VASHTORR THE ARKIFANE** unit of yours in that enemy unit's **Engagement Range**.\n\nFor the rest of that phase, whenever a non-**MONSTER**, non-**VEHICLE** enemy unit Falls Back from your unit's Engagement Range, each of its models takes a **[Desperate Escape test](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape)**, at -1 if the unit falling back is **Battle-shocked**.",
